ling  with this type of soldiers so they are  getting absolutely wrecked we see gene  or Jean at this point with longer hair  he is urging the other members of the  survey corps to make sure that they  avoid civilian casualties as much as  possible which again emphasizes that the  survey Corps are not bad people they're  just doing what they feel like they have  to do to survive  Jean has a brief exchange with flock  where flock reminds John that these are  the people who have been attacking and  slaughtering innocent civilians on the  island meaning you know don't be too  sentimental about them we came here to  do what we have to do this leads into a  really powerful conversation between  Mikasa and Aaron back in the plaza  Mieke sub with tears in her eyes says to  Annan do you understand what you've done  you've killed innocent people including  children that is already irredeemable so  this clearly implies that Mikasa either  wasn't fully aware of Aaron's plan or  she didn't agree with it but decided to  go along with it anyway yet again all of  this stresses the terrible nature of war  of course the LD ins on the island are  the victims here they were attacked  first they were attacked by Marly even  though they were just living behind the  walls and minding their own business  thousands of innocent civilians on the  island were brutally murdered but here's  the problem there are innocent civilians  in Marlay as well and that sucks because  Aaron and the others have no choice but  to attack clearly Marly is planning to  attack the island again and kill them  all they are relentless and they will  not stop until they are stopped by force  so I understand why the survey Corps is  doing what they're doing they have no  choice but it still sucks that innocent  civilians on the male side and also  children like you don't Sofia have to  suffer because of the decisions of other  people and by this I mean the male  government and military but that is also  how things un