ls I  am sick of the LD ins from RA hating  their own people and being so gullible  and believing this Marlay [ __ ] the  LD ins from the island were attacked  first the world wants to commit genocide  against them and exterminate them of  course they're going to fight back  they're fighting for their survival and  I am 100% behind them these LD ins in  Marlay need to wake up already  unfortunately at this point peek shows  up in her armored car Titan and starts  shooting down members of the survey  Corps  Aaron is distracted for an instant and  Willie's sister uses that opportunity to  create another Warhammer Titan body  while she is still inside the crystal  this confirms that she is still aware  and conscious while in the crystal which  means that any  is also aware and conscious inside her  crystal and this makes me think what is  going to happen with Annie is the fact  that the crystal has appeared again a  hint that Annie will be coming back  sometime soon  is this foreshadowing the chapter ends  as the Beast Titan approaches Zeke says  don't let them escape annihilate them  all as the cart jaws and Beast Titan  face-off against Aaron and the survey  Corps Gabi is also running towards the  battle for some reason with a gun  talking about killing Aaron I don't know  what she plans to do but we are in for a  rematch between Levi and the Beast Titan  we are in for an epic fight and don't  forget we haven't even seen Armin the  colossal Titan yet is he there somewhere  just waiting for the right moment to  strike also are those lights that they  were setting up related to Armin are  they supposed to signal where he is to  land and use the colossal Titans power  to explode and create a massive  explosion since we know that the survey  Corps is trying to avoid mass civilian  casualties this might suggest that no  Armin is not planning to explode but  what if the survey corps is planning to  lure all the male shifters in one  specific area marked by those lights and